		<key>PROJECT_COMMENTS</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NOTES</key>
			<string>Installer package for Local AI Development Environment Desktop GUI Application.

This Packages project creates a macOS installer that:
- Installs LocalAIDev.app to the /Applications folder
- Supports macOS 10.14 (Mojave) and newer
- Includes proper .app bundle structure with Info.plist
- Supports code signing when certificates are available

Requirements implemented:
- 8.7: Add application to Applications folder
- 8.9: Code sign (if certificate available)
- 7.6: Set Info.plist with version and icon
- 15.2: Support macOS 10.14 (Mojave) and newer

Build Instructions:
1. Open this file in Packages app (http://s.sudre.free.fr/Software/Packages/)
2. Configure code signing in Build settings (optional)
3. Build > Build to create the .pkg installer
4. Output will be in dist/LocalAIDev.pkg

Prerequisites:
- PyInstaller-built LocalAIDev.app in dist/ directory
- Packages app installed (brew install --cask packages)
- (Optional) Apple Developer certificate for code signing</string>
