							<key>TEMPLATE</key>
							<string>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html lang="en"&gt;
&lt;head&gt;
    &lt;meta charset="utf-8"/&gt;
    &lt;style&gt;
        body { 
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        h1 { 
            color: #007AFF;
            font-size: 22px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        p { margin: 8px 0; }
        ul { margin: 8px 0; padding-left: 24px; }
        li { margin: 4px 0; }
        strong { font-weight: 600; }
    &lt;/style&gt;
&lt;/head&gt;
&lt;body&gt;
    &lt;h1&gt;Welcome to Local AI Development Environment&lt;/h1&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;This installer will install Local AI Development Environment version 1.0.0 on your computer.&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Local AI Development Environment is a modern desktop GUI application that provides a user-friendly interface for AI-powered development tasks. It wraps the existing CLI functionality with real-time feedback, configuration management, and task history tracking.&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;ul&gt;
        &lt;li&gt;Intuitive graphical interface for AI development tasks&lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;li&gt;Real-time progress monitoring and feedback&lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;li&gt;Task history tracking and management&lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;li&gt;Visual configuration management&lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;li&gt;Light and dark theme support&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;/ul&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum System Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;ul&gt;
        &lt;li&gt;macOS 10.14 (Mojave) or later&lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;li&gt;64-bit Intel or Apple Silicon (M1/M2) processor&lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;li&gt;200 MB of available disk space&lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;li&gt;Internet connection for LLM communication&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;/ul&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;Click Continue to proceed with the installation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/body&gt;
&lt;/html&gt;</string>
